WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
- I could never have done what
you did, in order to get to--

00:00:05.910 --> 00:00:08.430
- I love competition.

00:00:08.430 --> 00:00:11.400
- See, yeah, me too.

00:00:11.400 --> 00:00:12.233
But I just think--

00:00:12.233 --> 00:00:13.610
- Even with yourself,
competing with yourself.

00:00:13.610 --> 00:00:14.880
- Yeah, but I just think

00:00:14.880 --> 00:00:18.900
it takes a certain level
of courage and confidence

00:00:18.900 --> 00:00:23.370
to be able to go on a show
and break through that way.

00:00:23.370 --> 00:00:27.270
I mean, I'm not being modest or anything.

00:00:27.270 --> 00:00:28.860
I could never have done that.

00:00:28.860 --> 00:00:30.570
I know what I'm capable of.

00:00:30.570 --> 00:00:31.403
- Which is hysterical though

00:00:31.403 --> 00:00:33.684
because your voice is like
what people are looking for.

00:00:33.684 --> 00:00:34.980
- I wouldn't have done it.

00:00:34.980 --> 00:00:36.423
I wouldn't have,

00:00:36.423 --> 00:00:39.540
it takes I think a
certain amount of courage

00:00:39.540 --> 00:00:42.030
to put yourself out there

00:00:42.030 --> 00:00:45.150
and be judged in amongst
other people, right?

00:00:45.150 --> 00:00:48.630
And be critiqued on a
show, on a world stage.

00:00:48.630 --> 00:00:53.630
I don't know if anyone
realizes how hard that is,

00:00:54.090 --> 00:00:56.010
to actually put yourself out there

00:00:56.010 --> 00:00:59.130
and people tell you how good
you were or how bad you were,

00:00:59.130 --> 00:01:02.820
and you having to take it
on a show like you did.

00:01:02.820 --> 00:01:05.850
I wouldn't have had
the courage to do that.

00:01:05.850 --> 00:01:08.010
And so I have so much admiration.

00:01:08.010 --> 00:01:08.843
- Well, thank you.

00:01:08.843 --> 00:01:09.676
- I think it was--
- But what was it like?

00:01:09.676 --> 00:01:11.790
- Really good bootcamp though
because it was really hard.

00:01:11.790 --> 00:01:13.920
And it was more hard not for
me but to watch other people.

00:01:13.920 --> 00:01:14.753
I'm always that person,

00:01:14.753 --> 00:01:15.840
like it's hard for me

00:01:15.840 --> 00:01:17.670
to watch other people
go through something.

00:01:17.670 --> 00:01:20.010
And like other artists
were not handling it well,

00:01:20.010 --> 00:01:21.480
like what people would say online.

00:01:21.480 --> 00:01:23.940
And it was the first time
the show was on or whatever,

00:01:23.940 --> 00:01:25.620
so that was harder,

00:01:25.620 --> 00:01:28.772
watching people break their spirit a bit.

00:01:28.772 --> 00:01:30.690
I think, and that sucks,

00:01:30.690 --> 00:01:34.590
but I will say it was a great
bootcamp because after that,

00:01:34.590 --> 00:01:36.510
I felt like, I mean,
this industry is hard.

00:01:36.510 --> 00:01:37.590
You say you couldn't handle it,

00:01:37.590 --> 00:01:39.960
but you did because this
industry is not easy.

00:01:39.960 --> 00:01:42.390
Even if you're selling 8 million
albums or doing whatever,

00:01:42.390 --> 00:01:44.490
there's always people just
trying to knock you down

00:01:44.490 --> 00:01:47.310
or say something just super (beep),

00:01:47.310 --> 00:01:48.855
I can't say that on TV.

00:01:48.855 --> 00:01:51.900
- But you went from nothing

00:01:51.900 --> 00:01:53.130
to all of a sudden being exposed.

00:01:53.130 --> 00:01:54.570
- But that's the trick though,

00:01:54.570 --> 00:01:56.220
I think that is the key.

00:01:56.220 --> 00:01:58.170
When you have no home,

00:01:58.170 --> 00:01:59.220
my place had burned down,

00:01:59.220 --> 00:02:01.500
I was living in my car for a bit,

00:02:01.500 --> 00:02:02.460
like I had nothing.

00:02:02.460 --> 00:02:03.450
I had nothing.

00:02:03.450 --> 00:02:05.700
And I think when you have nothing,

00:02:05.700 --> 00:02:06.900
you have nothing to lose

00:02:06.900 --> 00:02:09.330
so you just show up and you
go, sure, you can laugh,

00:02:09.330 --> 00:02:10.920
but if I'm getting paid,

00:02:10.920 --> 00:02:12.909
I'm laughing all the way to the bank, so.

00:02:12.909 --> 00:02:13.742
(audience clapping)
(audience cheering)

